codex-speed integrates a source patch for OpenAI Codex (Apache-2.0).
The TUI bridge portions of patches/codex.patch were adapted from cxstatusline
0.13.1, https://github.com/adrijshikhar/cxstatusline (MIT).
Its license is retained in patches/CXSTATUSLINE-LICENSE.
The lightweight Python renderer and installer are distributed under Apache-2.0.
This project is an independent customization and is not an official OpenAI plugin.
